[{"id":"payment","title":"Payment Terms","content":["A 50% advance payment is required to confirm and secure your order.","The remaining payment must be completed before dispatch of the order.","Orders will only enter production after payment confirmation.","Payments can be made through UPI and other available payment methods shared by ELAROSE.","Cash on Delivery (COD) is available only for selected local areas and approved orders.","Payment screenshots alone are not considered proof of payment until verification is completed.","For bulk or custom orders, full or partial advance payment may be required before work begins."]},{"id":"processing","title":"Order Processing","content":["Every ELAROSE product is handcrafted and made to order.","Standard production time is approximately 3–7 working days depending on design complexity and order volume.","Customised and bulk orders may require additional preparation time.","Rush orders may be accepted only after prior discussion and are subject to availability.","Production timelines begin only after payment confirmation.","Customers will receive order updates through Instagram or the order tracking page."]},{"id":"shipping","title":"Shipping & Delivery","content":["We deliver across India.","Local area deliveries are generally completed within 1 day after dispatch.","Delivery timelines for other cities depend on courier partners and destination.","Shipping charges are separate from product prices unless stated otherwise.","Customers are responsible for providing complete and accurate delivery details.","Once an order is handed over to the courier, delivery delays caused by courier operations, weather, strikes, or other external factors are beyond our control.","Tracking information will be provided once the order is dispatched."]},{"id":"packaging","title":"Special Packaging","content":["Every ELAROSE order is carefully packed with aesthetic and protective packaging.","Our products are designed to be gifting-ready upon arrival.","Different packaging styles may be offered depending on the occasion, such as birthdays, anniversaries, weddings, and special surprises.","Premium gift packaging and custom message cards may be available at additional cost.","We take extra care to ensure every package feels memorable and special."]},{"id":"cancellation","title":"Cancellation & Changes","content":["Order cancellations are accepted within 24 hours of placing the order.","Once production has started, cancellations are not possible.","Customised or personalised orders cannot be cancelled after design approval or production begins.","Requests for changes in color, design, personalization, delivery details, or packaging should be communicated as early as possible.","Change requests may not be possible once the order enters production.","Approved cancellations will be processed within 5–7 business days."]},{"id":"refund","title":"Refund & Replacement Policy","content":["As every product is handmade and made to order, refunds are generally not available.","If your order arrives damaged, please contact us within 24 hours of delivery and provide an unboxing video and photos.","Claims without an unboxing video may not qualify for replacement review.","If an incorrect item is delivered, we will arrange a replacement after verification.","Replacement decisions are made after reviewing the submitted evidence.","ELAROSE reserves the right to refuse fraudulent or unverifiable claims."]},{"id":"reviews","title":"Customer Reviews","content":["Customer reviews, feedback, and gifting moments may be featured on our website and social media platforms.","We are grateful for every review, recommendation, and customer photo shared with us.","By sharing photos, videos, or testimonials with ELAROSE, you grant permission for us to repost them for promotional purposes unless requested otherwise.","We love celebrating your special moments and showcasing the joy our creations bring."]},{"id":"privacy","title":"Privacy Policy","content":["We collect only the information required to process and deliver your order, including your name, contact details, and delivery address.","Your personal information is never sold or shared with third parties except when required for delivery services.","Payment information is not stored by ELAROSE.","We take reasonable measures to protect customer information.","Customer information is used only for order processing, communication, support, and delivery purposes."]},{"id":"terms","title":"Terms & Conditions","content":["All ELAROSE products are handmade, and slight variations in color, shape, or finish are part of the handcrafted process.","Product photographs are representative and may differ slightly from the final handmade piece.","Prices may change without prior notice.","ELAROSE reserves the right to refuse or cancel orders that violate our policies.","By placing an order, customers agree to all policies and terms listed on this website.","All designs, photographs, branding, content, and creative assets belong to ELAROSE and may not be copied or reused without permission."]}]